   1183           *                         MCI_MANUAL_INJECTION_DC_VOLTAGE - DC voltage, requires voltage level and position
   1184           *                         MCI_MANUAL_INJECTION_AC_VOLTAGE - AC voltage, requires voltage level and frequency
   1185           *                         MCI_MANUAL_INJECTION_DC_CURRENT - DC current, requires current level [A], current rate [A/s] and position [degree]
   1186           *                         MCI_MANUAL_INJECTION_AC_CURRENT - AC current, requires current level and frequency
   1187           *
   1188           * @param   level_x32 - targeted level x32;  [V] if selected method is voltage;
