   1190           * @param   level_rate_x32 - level rate x32; [V/s] if selected method is voltage;
   1191           *                                           [A/s] if method is current
   1192           * @param   param_x32 - auxiliary parameter x32; [Hz] if selected method is AC voltage/current;
   1193           *                                               [degree] if method is DC voltage/current
   1194           * @param   param_rate_x32 - auxiliary parameter rate x32; [Hz/s] if selected method is AC voltage/current;
   1195           *                                                         not used if method is DC voltage/current
   1196           * @return MCI_CMD_INDEX_OUT_RANGE     -7 - [T/F] - command was denied by Mci because selected motor does not exist
   1197           * @return MCI_CMD_STOP_REQUESTED      -6 - [T/F] - command was denied by Mci because motor is stopping by user request
   1198           * @return MCI_CMD_PARAM_NOT_LOADED    -5 - [T/F] - denied because parameters are not loaded
   1199           * @return MCI_CMD_TIMEOUT             -4 - [T/F] - timeout due to long feedback time
   1200           * @return MCI_CMD_RAMP_OUT_OF_RANGE   -3 - [T/F] - denied due to acceleration out of range
   1201           * @return MCI_CMD_SPEED_OUT_OF_RANGE  -2 - [T/F] - denied due to speed out of range
   1202           * @return MCI_CMD_DENIED              -1 - [T/F] - denied due reason not disclosed.
